# Web Untitled UI React

**Enforced constraints:**

**Component Library:**
- MUST use Untitled UI components from MCP server (don't build from scratch)
- MUST use `untitledui-docs` MCP tool for component discovery
- MUST follow kebab-case naming for component files
- MUST import from `@untitled-ui/icons-react` for icons
- MUST use React Aria imports (e.g., `AriaButtonProps`)

**File Organization:**
- MUST organize base components in `@/components/base/`
- MUST use consistent import aliases (`@/components`, `@/lib`, `@/utils`)

**Styling:**
- MUST use Untitled UI semantic color tokens (not arbitrary Tailwind colors)
- MUST use Untitled UI spacing and sizing conventions
- MUST extend with Tailwind utilities for layout only
- MUST NOT override Untitled UI component internals

**Component Installation:**
- MUST use `untitledui install` command or MCP tool
- MUST install dependencies when prompted
- MUST review component code after installation

**Customization:**
- MUST use Untitled UI theming system for design tokens
- MUST extend existing components (don't fork)
- MUST document custom variants in design system

See `instructions.md` for MCP workflow, component discovery patterns, theming setup, and integration examples.
